WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.700
Market Fit is an AI coach. It sharpens your pitch, and it sharpens you.

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:10.450
You built a lot. Outsiders give it ten seconds. The generous ones.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:12.800
[on screen: ShiftEngine. …so what does it do?]

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:18.350
Right. Market Fit asks what a buyer would ask. Who's it for? What hurts?

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:20.600
Say it's scheduling software.

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:25.650
A nurse calls in sick at five a.m. Her manager has two hours to fill the shift.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:29.050
She doesn't want an engine. She wants it covered.

00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:33.600
You answer. It pushes back. Each round, the pitch climbs.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.930
So do you, though not in a straight line.

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:41.000
It stops at the green zone: clear enough to launch a campaign.

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:44.330
Coaches that never stop are called podcasts.

00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:48.160
Market Fit. Find the fit, and grow while you do it.

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:52.700
[on screen: Market Fit. An AI coach that grows you while you find the fit. Get the skill: amplifier-skill-market-fit]

